Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...Giorno's brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,C-could it be...alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's forming a brand new hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's not going down\Nwithout a hell of a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that\Nthing away from his hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia and Mista might have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But how the hell do I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you are the best man,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't break it and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, woah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.66,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The miracles that make us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The peace of the door.\NThe body who will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The hope that we can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I must not utter a single sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't move any\Nfaster than the brooch,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or that thing will zero\Nin on me and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, everyone,\Nbut I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to help once it feeds\Non the brooch it'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,after me next now's my\Nchance to get out of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,sight the closet I can\Nhide in there for now this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,switch it must be the\Nchair's recline button of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,course this will be my\Nticket out of this nightmare
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,situation that beast\Nwill catch sight of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,seat moving and shift\Nits focus to go after it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,then i'll grab the brooch\Nand rush to the cockpit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what am i thinking i\Ncan't do something like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,that it's madness talk\Nabout having a death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,wish forget it i'll wait\Nthis out in the closet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,have i lost it it's like my\Nbody just acted on its own
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't making sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was determined to not press the\Nbutton, but then did it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Move nice and slow, like a Tai Chi master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two more meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow and deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, it already destroyed the seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means no more reclining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make another seat recline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it go after me and not the seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this liquid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that fleshy horror react\Nto it dripping to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.90,0:04:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are my boots even\Nwet in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was push the recline button.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So how the hell did they get drenched?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I didn't want\Nto go after that stupid ladybug!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have just stayed\Nout of this altogether!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me to drag me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What my boot just fell\Noff my foot. It's like
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it slid around and passed through my leg I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,don't understand any of\Nthis what just happened
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,here's your opportunity procure\Nthe brooch Quickly, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's speaking right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who's always been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you were a little girl,\Nnever once have I left your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Trish, I'm asking you\Nto retrieve that brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already made\Nthe decision, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting Giorno's hand\Nstarted you down this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But your hesitation weakens you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Act now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you have me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Trish. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.74,0:05:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the force who repelled\Nthat scum from your boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your inner power given form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of me as your unique ability. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.86,0:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you've made your decision, so act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You must protect Giorno's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But Trish, by keeping it from harm, you\Ngive Giorno and the others a chance at life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And it gives you a chance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up now! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do or\Nhow to protect this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know what to do, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ability made the seat malleable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Malleable?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's crazy, but I just\Nslipped right through the seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And I heard that\Nabomination in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers ripped off a chunk of its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It can stop bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,catch up to a speeding plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and even annihilate objects moving\Nat high speeds without issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But when it hits a still object, it\Nbreaks apart like hamburger meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you actually me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean my essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And did I really just do all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My boot slipping off my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've secured the brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.98,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deep determination\Novercame your cowardice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are growing much stronger, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentally and emotionally as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lovely to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is to transform any\Nmatter into a malleable object.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to make things soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet even more durable than diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remain completely still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally get that we're the same entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got to get out of sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, make the closet elastic! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting in here! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, it managed to sniff me out all\Nthe way back here. I'm... I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm supposed to\Nbe a stand user now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can use all of these\Nspecial powers or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Its users already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop this murderous blob!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, this is why I\Nasked you to remain still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.60,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, our primary\Nduty should be reaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But we went the other direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Journo's brooch is nothing but!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,of Robbing Incubator at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to rescue it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All this power does is soften stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely dodge these attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It went after the clock again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The clock has been elasticized? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as your movements don't\Nexceed the speed of the second hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the clock should hold the\Nattention of the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,giving you an opportunity to\Nescape and rush to the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to remain\Nstill, but I misspoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant to move stealthily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Slower than the second hand, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In truth, you must move as\Nslowly as a glacier in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All the while possessing\Nthe power of an iron vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pulverize this\Nrotten heap of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear it scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris di merda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you do us all\Na favor and just die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this easy on yourself We both\Nknow you want to croak, so do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's breaking down into tiny pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it evaporating?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,After all that trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this vile killer of a stand is now\Njust a pile of disintegrating flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're a team, what do I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Spicy Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird, but in a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your bravery, Mista and\NNarancia won't die from their wounds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Giorno Giovanna\Nsure is a special one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, he's a giver of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But in addition, he is a catalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching him has caused you to mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure the engines\Nare working properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Luchirati, there's something\Nthat you ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for us to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno's already begun his plan to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Triss, whatever it is, it can wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.68,0:11:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Move slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crucial that you\Ncarefully inch toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at 7,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:11:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,6,800.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,6,600.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dropping like a sack of\Nrocks, but I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As to why we're losing\Naltitude, I have the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, I'm at a complete\Nloss regarding what to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but I'm stumped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.06,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you\Ntalking about, Bucurati?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say about moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did it even...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno said the beast\Nlatches onto moving objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're captured, it devours them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the plane's engines...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In a word, they've been... eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, keep looking forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You must remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving toward me, nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.56,0:13:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't stop us from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to get up close\Nand personal with the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we'd be lucky to hit the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,These engines are going to blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was torn to pieces and evaporated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.74,0:13:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The engine is located behind the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A cell or two must have passed through\Na crevice in the wall of the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be having a field day\Nfeeding on the power of the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to crash land.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.42,0:13:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the Terranian Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for a water landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,An emergency landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if by some miracle we manage to land\Non the water in one piece, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll still try to hunt us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.32,0:13:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find any weaknesses in this stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow and steady, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:13:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Move like a tiger closing in on its prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm and deliberate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing so will just invite its attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna latch onto you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.16,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're damn right it\Nwill, but what does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing will happen\Neven if I move like a slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So why not take the gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.76,0:14:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get your ass back in\Nthe cockpit, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've completely lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The door's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Power. Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This girl is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An emergency landing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you've got the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to live long enough to\Nsee Sardinia with your own eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,we've no choice but to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bust this death trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wannabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world? These powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get stand abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls, the glass, everything\Nin here is elastic like rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty obvious by now that this\Nmeatloaf from Hell has a need for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the bastard's in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A plane falling from the sky\Nmoves faster than a parachute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat it! Bitch meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing got us good,\Nbut it's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that our plane is nothing but smoldering\Nscrap metal at the bottom of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This way,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the boss's henchmen\Nwill never know whether
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,we survived or went down\Nin a blaze of glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's genius, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We shook off the Family and\Nthey never even saw it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means we'll have\Nsome time on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to hunt down the\Nbastard like a rabid dog
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and show the world what\Na coward he really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Much as I hate to say it,\Nwe're not out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature is still\Nhunting us this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna get rid of it for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My zipper will be more\Nthan enough to end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it possible? We...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,roasted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no weaknesses that I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only chance is to follow Jono's\Nlead and use velocity to drive it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't mean what I think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really gonna\Nlet him feed on your...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be a hero so bad\Nyou'll throw your life away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Abbacchio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's throwing their\Nlives away anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jono's life-invigorating\Nessence is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's ready for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrivederci.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Notorious Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is known as the stand\Nthat's impossible to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but is tragically doomed to chase\Nthe endless crash of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,On the rare occasion a speeding\Nvessel moves faster than the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.34,0:17:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it strikes out in a ravenous embrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The seas of its watery\Npurgatory would be known
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,to fishermen as the\Nbowels of the Tyrrhenian,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the waters where sailors go to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's pull our own disappearing\Nact and unmask this bastard boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever he's hiding, we're gonna find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,News agencies are reporting\Nthat a private plane has crashed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,into the Tyrrhenian Sea some 50\Nkilometers northeast of Sardinia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,shortly after taking off\Nfrom Marco Polo Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time, the incident remains a mystery\Nall passengers remain unaccounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I might do away with the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet it still reveals\Nits rose-stained head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there goes my short-lived peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere interloper would\Nbe an annoyance for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But family...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Family makes this matter\Nso much more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But blood is simply blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I blot this aberration\Nout of existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forever be the pinnacle\Nof success and status.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Several days after Pericolo\Ntook responsibility for Trish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,those traitors scoured this apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the one Trish and her\Nmother used to call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But none of them noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.62,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Till recently, Trish greeted\Nthe day from this very room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And every day, she'd spend her\Ntime poring over this photograph,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the one picture her mother loved\Nand cherished more than any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no confusing this date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:20:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible that something like\Nthis nearly slipped my notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Moronic, sentimental crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Their plane crashed and\Nburned, yet they live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it in my flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter's powers have awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and her body practically radiates\Nlife as she nears Sardinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If a Bacchios stand had any\Ninvolvement in flying that plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's no question that\Nbastard is also still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.22,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Moody Jazz must never reach\Nthe location in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's repressed, but eventually\Nthe memory will resurface.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't totally forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in Sardinia, the\Nmemories will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll remember it was\Nhere that it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who took the photo of her\Nbeautiful young mother 15 years ago was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:21:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That point in time must never be\Nsubject to Moody Jazz's replay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the one task that\NI can only entrust myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my! I'm terribly sorry I knocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,but um i'm here to clean your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please you must forgive me\Ni'll return a bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear me. Now just what\Nwas I doing in here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes how could i forget i have to\Nclean the room time waits for no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're accusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not always are we knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is just fiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But they dare to tell us\NWhat's bad and what's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.28,0:22:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To save us a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause they're the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we are fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fighting for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.36,0:24:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
